WEBVTT

00:01:29.990 --> 00:01:34.990
Suigin Meets Takeshi!

00:01:40.540 --> 00:01:43.830
One Year Ago, Somewhere

00:01:48.030 --> 00:01:49.700
Day after day...

00:01:50.440 --> 00:01:51.990
It keeps coming down, doesn't it?

00:01:52.430 --> 00:01:54.090
Y-Yeah...

00:01:55.730 --> 00:01:56.950
Say, Takeshi.

00:01:58.020 --> 00:02:00.220
What have you been thinking about?

00:02:00.850 --> 00:02:02.260
I-I'm...

00:02:02.760 --> 00:02:08.510
I'm gonna make some money in this 
game and leave this town someday.

00:02:14.260 --> 00:02:16.360
Where do you plan to go?

00:02:18.630 --> 00:02:21.370
Someplace that's like heaven and not here.

00:02:22.460 --> 00:02:24.610
I wanna go, too.

00:02:25.360 --> 00:02:30.380
I-I wouldn't mind taking you 
with me, Mikan-neechan.

00:02:30.730 --> 00:02:32.950
Thanks, Takeshi.

00:02:45.930 --> 00:02:47.690
Stop looking around.

00:02:47.690 --> 00:02:48.600
Let's go.

00:02:55.810 --> 00:02:57.600
Riku Rei,

00:02:58.030 --> 00:03:01.260
as we present you with this red console,

00:03:01.610 --> 00:03:07.420
we welcome you as a member of Totems.

00:03:29.060 --> 00:03:32.480
Stage 10

00:03:30.230 --> 00:03:32.480
Twin Battle Gate

00:03:32.480 --> 00:03:35.150
Prize Money 10 Million!!

00:03:32.480 --> 00:03:35.150
Grave Buster Ultimate Martial Arts Tournament

00:03:33.350 --> 00:03:35.140
Huh? Why?!

00:03:35.450 --> 00:03:38.070
Why can't I enter the 
martial arts tournament?

00:03:38.440 --> 00:03:42.840
Sir, you need this entry fee 
if you'd like to enter.

00:03:43.330 --> 00:03:44.900
F-Fifty thousand yen?!

00:03:45.690 --> 00:03:47.450
What would you like to do?

00:03:47.810 --> 00:03:48.920
Damn it!

00:03:50.450 --> 00:03:54.700
If you can't pay the damn 
fee then get outta here.

00:03:54.700 --> 00:03:55.720
Pardon me!

00:03:55.720 --> 00:03:57.230
Can I get a flier?

00:03:57.230 --> 00:03:59.390
Yes, welcome!

00:04:09.140 --> 00:04:10.290
So high up...

00:04:10.730 --> 00:04:11.550
Hey.

00:04:12.370 --> 00:04:15.530
Do you know where Laolong 
the matchmaker is?

00:04:19.530 --> 00:04:21.720
U-Um...

00:04:22.760 --> 00:04:24.700
How long are you going to make us wait?

00:04:24.700 --> 00:04:26.570
Hurry up and start!

00:04:27.090 --> 00:04:29.570
I'm Riku Suigin. What's your name?

00:04:29.780 --> 00:04:31.530
T-Takeshi.

00:04:31.820 --> 00:04:37.050
I'm worn out! Why do we 
have to watch from here?

00:04:37.360 --> 00:04:39.840
I'm not here to watch the 
martial arts tournament!

00:04:39.840 --> 00:04:44.860
I don't want to pay the expensive entry fee
 just to see the matchmaker, Laolong.

00:04:46.030 --> 00:04:50.130
Could it be that you want to hide the 
fact that you're a billion player?

00:04:50.470 --> 00:04:52.280
I tend to be frugal.

00:04:52.910 --> 00:04:54.520
Are you here to watch the tournament?

00:04:54.850 --> 00:04:57.290
I came to enter the tournament.

00:04:57.730 --> 00:05:02.480
I figured I'd wait and check out 
the atmosphere of the event first.

00:05:02.480 --> 00:05:03.860
Hey, over there!

00:05:04.200 --> 00:05:05.340
Isn't that him?

00:05:07.260 --> 00:05:10.880
That's Laolong. He's in charge 
of the beginners' courses.

00:05:11.240 --> 00:05:12.240
Let's go!

00:05:12.720 --> 00:05:14.370
Hey, wait a sec.

00:05:14.790 --> 00:05:19.230
Ladies and gentlemen! 
Thank you for waiting!

00:05:19.230 --> 00:05:22.460
Allow me to introduce the finalists!

00:05:24.050 --> 00:05:26.600
The self-proclaimed best 
ice-user in the land!

00:05:26.600 --> 00:05:30.060
The fighter of the stormy seas,
 Mammoth Viking!

00:05:30.990 --> 00:05:34.760
His opponent is the number one ice-user!

00:05:34.760 --> 00:05:37.620
The frost magician, Eeyuu!

00:05:38.380 --> 00:05:41.070
The best versus the number one, eh?

00:05:41.070 --> 00:05:43.770
Looks like they're on the same level 
when it comes to boasting.

00:05:44.330 --> 00:05:46.550
They only have one goal!

00:05:46.550 --> 00:05:50.290
The ten-million-yen real-money prize 
that will be awarded to the winner,

00:05:50.510 --> 00:05:54.950
and the supplementary prize, 
an ice snow leopard.

00:05:54.950 --> 00:05:57.510
Ten million yen... That's a lot.

00:05:58.160 --> 00:06:00.890
All right, gentlemen, 
this is your final battle.

00:06:00.890 --> 00:06:03.000
Ready, go!

00:06:03.460 --> 00:06:08.080
The prize money and the 
snow leopard belong to me!

00:06:08.570 --> 00:06:11.720
Hah! That attack didn't even tickle!

00:06:15.790 --> 00:06:17.640
I'm gonna crush you!

00:06:18.160 --> 00:06:20.340
Talk about being all brute strength!

00:06:22.170 --> 00:06:25.700
The frost magician Eeyuu has been cornered!

00:06:25.700 --> 00:06:27.150
No, take a closer look...

00:06:27.150 --> 00:06:28.800
Look at how calm he looks.

00:06:30.050 --> 00:06:34.220
<i>Keep it up. You have no idea that you're 
bringing yourself to your own doom.</i>

00:06:36.070 --> 00:06:37.840
<i>I'll end it now.</i>

00:06:48.530 --> 00:06:50.270
Wh-What the?!

00:06:58.440 --> 00:07:00.260
I think there's a bit more going on...

00:07:00.260 --> 00:07:01.910
Huh? Really?

00:07:02.640 --> 00:07:04.650
Who do you think is going to win?

00:07:05.540 --> 00:07:08.110
Neither one is gonna win...

00:07:08.320 --> 00:07:09.240
Huh?

00:07:09.800 --> 00:07:11.430
The one who's gonna win 
the ten million yen...

00:07:11.430 --> 00:07:13.730
is me!

00:07:17.830 --> 00:07:19.620
Now you're finished!

00:07:22.700 --> 00:07:26.350
S-Something unbelievable has happened!

00:07:27.140 --> 00:07:28.630
Ow...

00:07:31.220 --> 00:07:32.760
Oh, man...

00:07:32.760 --> 00:07:37.140
Sorry, sorry. It just 
started shining suddenly.

00:07:38.810 --> 00:07:41.400
You'll have to fight me this match.

00:07:41.400 --> 00:07:43.570
What are you talking about, brat?

00:07:43.570 --> 00:07:46.360
True! It's written in the rules book that

00:07:46.360 --> 00:07:49.490
if an intruder happens to defeat 
one of the participants,

00:07:49.500 --> 00:07:53.150
they will have the right to 
participate in the battle instead.

00:07:53.660 --> 00:07:54.960
Right?

00:07:56.120 --> 00:07:59.380
And so, the intruders' IDs:

00:07:59.380 --> 00:08:04.880
Takeshi and Riku Suigin are now designated 
as the challenging team in the final match!

00:08:05.890 --> 00:08:08.080
What the heck's with that messed up rule?

00:08:08.760 --> 00:08:11.350
Sorry to get you caught up in all of this.

00:08:11.800 --> 00:08:16.100
But I need that prize money of 
ten million yen, no matter what!

00:08:21.080 --> 00:08:23.680
<i>We were always together ever 
since we were little...</i>

00:08:24.040 --> 00:08:25.400
<i>Mikan-neechan.</i>

00:08:25.400 --> 00:08:27.490
Here. That's your share, Takeshi.

00:08:27.960 --> 00:08:31.010
Now we'll be able to make money, too!

00:08:32.140 --> 00:08:34.250
If you win in the game.

00:08:34.250 --> 00:08:36.210
I will! No matter what!

00:08:40.480 --> 00:08:44.960
Why do you keep running away? 
You're not going to get any stronger that way.

00:08:45.190 --> 00:08:46.970
That's not true!

00:08:46.970 --> 00:08:51.500
With this paladin's memoirs, your fighting 
power increases, even if you don't fight.

00:08:51.810 --> 00:08:53.330
Even if you don't fight?

00:08:53.750 --> 00:08:56.340
Yeah! Look, like this.

00:09:01.520 --> 00:09:07.030
If you put a photograph in here like this 
every day, you get stronger little by little.

00:09:07.250 --> 00:09:08.680
Huh...

00:09:09.300 --> 00:09:12.900
So that's why you're sneaking 
photos of me every day.

00:09:12.900 --> 00:09:15.750
Th-That's not...

00:09:15.970 --> 00:09:19.710
You totally are! I know what you're up to.

00:09:20.330 --> 00:09:21.190
I'm sorry...

00:09:21.410 --> 00:09:25.640
I mean... I'm always with 
you, Mikan-neechan.

00:09:25.640 --> 00:09:26.710
Let me see.

00:09:27.980 --> 00:09:29.290
Come on.

00:09:32.450 --> 00:09:33.670
Well, well...

00:09:33.670 --> 00:09:35.150
You won't get mad?

00:09:35.490 --> 00:09:40.460
Of course not. They're our 
precious memories, Takeshi.

00:09:41.630 --> 00:09:44.970
You're my precious partner, Takeshi.

00:09:53.470 --> 00:09:54.910
Mikan-neechan!

00:09:56.160 --> 00:09:57.400
You'll get better!

00:09:57.740 --> 00:09:59.490
I just know you'll get better, Nee-chan.

00:09:59.910 --> 00:10:02.790
If you're at a bigger hospital...

00:10:02.790 --> 00:10:05.360
I'll go make the money...

00:10:06.770 --> 00:10:08.010
You dummy.

00:10:08.560 --> 00:10:13.040
I'll be fine. You need to 
get out of this town...

00:10:15.660 --> 00:10:17.390
I'm going to save her!

00:10:17.390 --> 00:10:20.090
I'm going to win, no matter what!

00:10:20.690 --> 00:10:22.720
Takeshi, you...

00:10:24.820 --> 00:10:27.930
Y'all ain't gonna beat me!

00:10:27.930 --> 00:10:29.390
Why?!

00:10:29.390 --> 00:10:32.990
Intruders will have to 
take a slight penalty.

00:10:33.430 --> 00:10:34.820
Penalty?

00:10:34.820 --> 00:10:39.160
Regardless of circumstances, 
intruders will have their abilities halved.

00:10:39.160 --> 00:10:40.620
That is the penalty!

00:10:42.190 --> 00:10:46.620
You ain't gonna be no match for 
me with that puny strength!

00:10:46.620 --> 00:10:49.630
A-Abilities cut in half?

00:10:49.630 --> 00:10:52.350
You didn't even understand the rules?

00:10:52.350 --> 00:10:54.120
Talk about doing something rash...

00:10:54.120 --> 00:10:57.330
Even then... Even then, I won't lose!

00:11:03.370 --> 00:11:04.600
Oh, what's this?

00:11:04.600 --> 00:11:08.270
Apparently that item converts 
photographs into fighting power!

00:11:10.760 --> 00:11:16.450
Indeed! With every attack the memories 
contained within the photograph disappear!

00:11:16.740 --> 00:11:18.440
The memories disappear?!

00:11:21.650 --> 00:11:23.830
I don't care if all my 
memories disappear!

00:11:25.780 --> 00:11:29.470
If that's what it takes... 
to save Mikan-neechan!

00:12:59.930 --> 00:13:04.920
Next Time
Suigin's New Journey!

00:13:02.160 --> 00:13:03.650
The Silver Guardian!
